Ampere handle decoding and per-load vector groups from the newer translator.
Rebuild both native architectures and preserve the current upstream rewrites.
Reduce dead-result float atomic adds before general atomic lowering, keeping
collectives uniform and masking nonmatching addresses during grouped sums.

